/// NetworkNodePackage projection
///
/// Purpose:
/// - Expose the Network-owned package rail for Workspace/package consumers.
/// - Keep `NetworkNodeConfig` as the semantic desired-state root under the package boundary.
/// - Avoid collapsing package truth and live `NetworkNode` runtime state into one object.
projection NetworkNodePackage is_branchable {
    root network.NetworkNodePackage

    network.NetworkNodePackage::network_node_config NetworkNodeConfig
}
